cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article and the archived release."
title: "vbd-cdm: an auditable integration framework for heterogeneous vector-borne disease data"
abstract: >-
  vbd-cdm integrates heterogeneous vector-borne disease data — occurrence records,
  insecticide-resistance bioassays, climate reanalysis, gridded disease burden,
  socioeconomic indicators and administrative boundaries — into one normalised
  common data model, and records the vocabulary decision behind every
  standardised value.
